WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.460
Now go and look.

00:02.160 --> 00:04.190
That is tonight, from where you are.

00:04.640 --> 00:11.672
The sky you saw is already turning: come back in an hour and every star has moved a hand's width to the west.

00:12.122 --> 00:14.401
None of it needs a telescope.

00:14.851 --> 00:18.361
It needs ten minutes for your eyes to get used to the dark.
